  "slug": "primitive-binary-ramification-four-and-five-is-automorphic-5c216c29",
  "source": [],
  "statement": "Assume the Program 2 structural reductions place a quartic Keller map in the primitive coprime binary-pencil locus, with H4=(P,Q,0), P,Q in k[x,y]_4 coprime, R=(H3)_3 in k[x,y]_3, U=J(Q,R), V=J(P,R), W=J(P,Q), and r=deg gcd(U,V,W). If r is four or five, then the full Keller map is a polynomial automorphism.",
  "title": "Primitive Binary Ramification Four and Five Is Automorphic",
